{"server":"cn","storyId":"act24side_level_act24side_08_end","groupId":"act24side","stageId":"act24side_08","title":"奸诈者必自食恶果","storyCode":"CF-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act24side/level_act24side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"7b4b997053230b1efb829acca427772973763dd60d673a63fcb44e5acb94e872","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g6_redleafforestB"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噫——啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（剧烈的喘息）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷子，快趴下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去死吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没说你！是这只畜生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快趴下，我的源石技艺马上就要爆炸了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来拉您，没事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你手上的那是什么武器......那几头野兽瞬间被解决掉了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的独门狩猎绝技——就是用这个施术单元所施放的源石技艺，没人学得来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，小把戏而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的靠陷阱可以撑一会，后面就交给须本他们，我们可以去那边防御相对薄弱的地方......老爷子，您走慢点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要废话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这是什么表情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，只是有点怀念以前猎人们一起并肩作战的日子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，已经七年了，这是您第一次没有让我滚开，也没有骂我叛徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......没有想到您竟然真的会拿起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明的狩猎矛，直说就好，我知道你是明的师父。没想到我会去杀那些野兽吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟您当时不是猎人，也反对阿明来做猎人，阿明的牺牲......让您改变了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷子，其实有件事......您也许一直有误解，这么多年，我......也不知道该如何向您开口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时并不是我没有救他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诱兽粉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？您知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是他的父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这臭小子，他......是自己找死，就为了保护你们的矿场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到现在，我还是常常梦见那天夜里他脸上的表情，他的动作，他的眼睛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......到处是野兽的叫声，他最后想要对我说什么，但声音被淹没在喧嚣里，我还记得他苍白的嘴唇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道他是在说......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g3_redleafforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿明！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*东国粗口*，怎么会有这么多野兽？你要做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道你对自己用了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生明","speakerId":"avg_npc_760_1","isRemote":false,"text":"师父，你们回去，绝对不要跟上来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你回来啊！我们可以在这里挡住它们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生明","speakerId":"avg_npc_760_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，师父！你比谁都清楚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生明","speakerId":"avg_npc_760_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这等规模的兽潮不是我们可以击退的......很多人会受伤，甚至会有人牺牲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生明","speakerId":"avg_npc_760_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石矿场会被破坏，你们付出的所有心血都将会毁于一旦，我不能让这种事情发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明你是最反对开矿场的不是吗？毁掉就毁掉了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我回来！没有什么比你活着更重要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生明","speakerId":"avg_npc_760_1","isRemote":false,"text":"野兽都聚过来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生明","speakerId":"avg_npc_760_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间不多了，师父。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生明","speakerId":"avg_npc_760_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我反对矿场的开发，源石是危险的未知之物，一定会带来无法预估的灾难......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生明","speakerId":"avg_npc_760_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也无法接受你们杀死那些无辜的生命。舍弃敬畏，放任贪婪，最终的结果只会是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生明","speakerId":"avg_npc_760_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我同样记得那天我们一起去到城市，看到的那些凭借源石而起的楼宇，那些耀眼的霓虹和闪亮的招牌......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生明","speakerId":"avg_npc_760_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石是有价值的，它会帮助村子脱离现在困难的处境，能成为大家生存的依靠......已经走到了这一步，你们要好好地抓住这个机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿明！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生明","speakerId":"avg_npc_760_1","isRemote":false,"text":"猎人就是要为了族群的存续挺身而出，是你教我的，记得吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！滚开！你们这些畜生！不要再拦着我了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生明","speakerId":"avg_npc_760_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兽潮，生命的愤怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生明","speakerId":"avg_npc_760_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我亦是为生存而面对它们，这是一场对等的战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生明","speakerId":"avg_npc_760_1","isRemote":false,"text":"师父，最后答应我一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生明","speakerId":"avg_npc_760_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今后，请带领大家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生明","speakerId":"avg_npc_760_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活下去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿明！你回来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生明","speakerId":"avg_npc_760_1","isRemote":false,"text":"师父，最后一句话，请帮我转达给我的父亲，那个顽固的老头子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g6_redleafforestB"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他说的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“对不起，父亲。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......你不用再编些话骗我了，他可从来没有喊过我父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臭小子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是我啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"从这里看去只能看到老人的背影。\n但他听见了水珠落下的声音。\n深藏已久的泪水，盈满了纵横交错的沟壑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很想他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在天上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是那头怪物......它果然来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"野兽又来了！*东国粗口*，怎么比之前多这么多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶，人手根本不够！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就在这里！布置刚刚那种陷阱，把野兽挡住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不许过去，让我去处理那家伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是猎人，那是我的猎物！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g2_easternvillageB"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀！火龙来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然还是来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"随从艾露猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_750_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我们之前激怒它太多次了，它将人类都视作了威胁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它落在了柏生家附近，正在往这边靠近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"支援......还要一段时间才能抵达，村民们还没有全到避难所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偏偏选在这个时候......没办法了，你看着撤离的队伍，我去——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀！那边！有野兽出现了！数量在五只左右！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兽潮肯定到了，猎人们的封锁没办法完全抵挡所有来袭的野兽，必须优先保护眼前撤离的人群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那怎么办？眼睁睁地看着火龙逼近吗？那只会是更糟糕的危机！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"俺在想了......要找个办法阻挡火龙一段时间，至少等俺们把村民全部带过去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柏生先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找柏生先生帮忙吗？可是一时找不到他，而且仅凭他一个人也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到他了，就在屋子旁边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他离火龙很近！夜刀，俺们是不是要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他能够拖住火龙，我们就有时间去继续撤离村民了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"avg_1030_noirc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀，你是说......不去帮他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_1029_Yato2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......只能相信他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g2_easternvillageB"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拧开油桶盖子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，你也觉得吧？今天真是个好日子，天空烧得亮堂堂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近发生了好多事，长大的女娃子回了村，闹得鸡犬不宁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"突然有长着翅膀的怪物飞下来四处喷火，又来了两位不知好歹的外乡人在森林里惹麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后来野兽就一窝蜂地冲了出来，他们的矿场也爆炸了，不知道为什么就来了天灾，那些人连逃跑都乱成一团。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最可笑的是什么呢？从早到晚，又到早，老是有人跑过来，把过去那些烂在泥里的事挖出来，在我面前翻来覆去地讲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些家伙啊，全都口口声声说着为我好，却用他们捡起来的过去，一片片地割开我的血肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是黑角那娃子说的对，真相其实一点儿也不重要，过去就该让它留在过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死掉的人就让他死掉好了，一把火烧得干干净净，什么也别剩下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_i08"},{"type":"narration","text":"他听见了火光的呜咽，吞下那些来自往昔的残篇。\n时间的灰烬在他眼中飘摇，焚尽了所有悔恨的目光。\n燃烧吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是漂亮的火光啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明，如果你还在的话，你肯定也会这么做吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会迈出下一步的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g2_easternvillageB"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！看这边！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这头怪物，连嘴角都被烧焦了，鳞片上满是疤痕，你可真丑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？冒出火星了，你在愤怒吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要再挣扎了，你的目标只能有一个，只有我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死死盯着我......没错！就是这样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愤怒......更加愤怒吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"面对我！怪物！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
